# Every text file is normalized to LF in the repository and on checkout, so the
# .prettierrc endOfLine "lf" contract holds on Windows too (core.autocrlf cannot
# reintroduce CRLF into the working tree).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary asset formats are left untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ico binary
